.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-config - Manage Orbit CLI configuration


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit config [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
View, update, and manage persistent Orbit CLI configuration (~/.config/orbit/config.yaml).
Supports hierarchical resolution with environment variables and command-line flags.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to configuration file

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for config


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-get(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-init(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-list(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-path(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-set(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-show(1)\fP, \fBorbit-config-unset(1)\fP
